# Ignore — FACT
#
# Scope note: FACT is a container-bound Google Apps Script project. The .js and
# .html files at the repository root ARE the deployed application, so almost
# nothing in the project tree is ignorable. This file exists mainly to keep
# credentials, OS cruft, and local tooling output out of a PUBLIC repository.

# --- Credentials: never commit (AGENTS.md §4.1) ---
# clasp writes its OAuth tokens here. Committing this would publish a working
# credential for all three Apps Script environments.
.clasprc.json
.clasp.json.tmp
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Local tooling output from scripts/ ---
# These transcripts contain `gh auth status` output. The token is masked, but
# there is no reason to publish them on a public repository.
scripts/*-result.txt

# --- Node tooling (verification only; FACT has no runtime dependencies) ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.npm/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Logs and scratch ---
*.log
*.tmp
.cache/
